# Real item definitions live here locally but are NOT published to this repo —
# they reference workshop / third-party models and are a server-specific catalog.
#
# Tracked instead: __category.lua (category configs) and _example.lua templates.
# Both start with "_", so they are re-included by the rule below. Anything else
# (the actual item .lua files) is ignored.
*.lua
!_*.lua
